+- VALIDATION: targeted fencing/terminstance/axpane tests and both mutation batteries are green; the configured 30-command suite is being rerun after the final documentation/harness edits and its exit codes will be attached in the outcome.
+- BOUNDS: no public `ax` CLI row is claimed; attach/takeover is measured at `axpane.Decide` and direct fencing at `Authorize`. `internal/traceability` was not edited. Candidate remains UNCOMMITTED in the managed Story worktree.
